fn gui_rgba8888_row_tile_rle_present_host_span_operation_presenter_executor_session_turn_step_from_poll_result %fn GuiRgba8888RowTileRlePresentHostSpanOperationPresenterExecutorSessionTurnPollResult GuiRgba8888RowTileRlePresentHostSpanOperationPresenterExecutorSessionTurnStepResult \poll_result:
